<h2>Questions from Wenatchee property owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Do you serve Leavenworth and Lake Chelan?<svg class="ico chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. We cover Leavenworth, Cashmere, Chelan, Manson, East Wenatchee and properties throughout Chelan and Douglas counties.</p></div></details><details><summary>My cabin is only used seasonally. Does that affect my claim?<svg class="ico chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>It can. Policies may have vacancy or unoccupancy conditions and requirements to maintain heat. Check your policy and keep records of how you maintain the property.</p></div></details></div>
